<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS3" title="In 3.2 Method ‣ 3 AT Agents for Claims Processing ‣ ATA: A Neuro-Symbolic Approach to Implement Autonomous and Trustworthy Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.2.3 </span>Automated Theorem Proving (Decision Engine) - Check <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>-validity</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
